[19.115076, "o", "usage: gpu [-h] [--key KEY] [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--cwd CWD] [--detach] [--config CONFIG] {policy,run,stop,status,wait,sync} [args ...]\r\n\r\nGPU boxes through a shared Modal service\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  {policy,run,stop,status,wait,sync}\r\n  args\r\n\r\noptions:\r\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\r\n  --key KEY             Reuse this request ID after a lost response\r\n  --timeout TIMEOUT     Optional timeout for the remote command, in seconds\r\n  --cwd CWD\r\n  --detach\r\n  --config CONFIG       Optional JSON config instead of environment configuration\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  gpu policy\r\n  gpu run [options] -- PROGRAM [ARG ...]\r\n  gpu stop BOX\r\n  gpu status COMMAND\r\n  gpu wait COMMAND\r\n  gpu sync\r\n\r\nrun starts a GPU box for its command and returns command and box IDs.\r\nThe box stops when that command exits. run waits unless --detach is set.\r\nCPU /workspace writes are committed before each run; GPU writes commit on exit.\r\ngpu sync commits and reloads the CPU workspace view.\r\nstatus and wait take the retu"]
[19.115139, "o", "rned command IDs.\r\nThe -- separator starts the remote program and its arguments.\r\n"]
